sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as MCP Client / AI Agent
    participant Router as OpenShift Router<br/>Route rhoai-mcp<br/>443/TCP HTTPS edge TLS
    participant MCP as rhoai-mcp pod<br/>8000/TCP HTTP plaintext
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant MR as Model Registry<br/>8080 HTTP / 8443 HTTPS
    participant MC as Model Catalog<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,K8s: Flow 1 - Agent tool call (OIDC token-review + user-token)
    Client->>Router: POST /mcp (streamable-http JSON-RPC)<br/>Auth: Bearer OCP token
    Router->>MCP: Forward /mcp HTTP plaintext<br/>Bearer forwarded
    MCP->>K8s: TokenReview + GET users.user.openshift.io<br/>Auth: SA token
    K8s-->>MCP: Authenticated user + groups (UserContext)
    MCP->>K8s: SubjectAccessReview per tool mapping<br/>Auth: SA token
    K8s-->>MCP: allowed / denied (error means deny)
    MCP->>K8s: Resource CRUD (Notebook, InferenceService, ...)<br/>Auth: user's Bearer token
    K8s-->>MCP: Result (user's own RBAC applies)
    MCP-->>Router: JSON-RPC result
    Router-->>Client: HTTPS response

    Note over Client,K8s: Flow 2 - Agent tool call (SA mode, RHOAI overlay)
    Client->>Router: GET /sse, POST /messages/<br/>Auth: NONE
    Router->>MCP: Forward HTTP SSE plaintext<br/>Auth: NONE
    MCP->>K8s: Kubernetes API calls<br/>Auth: SA token (cluster-wide ClusterRole)<br/>read-only enforced in app
    K8s-->>MCP: Result
    MCP-->>Client: SSE events

    Note over MCP,MC: Flow 3 - Navigator / Planner (local mode)
    MCP->>MC: Benchmark sync at startup<br/>HTTPS TLS service-serving CA<br/>SA token / MODEL_CATALOG_TOKEN
    MC-->>MCP: Benchmarks
    Client->>MCP: Planner tool call (auth per Flow 1/2)
    MCP->>MCP: In-process llm-d-planner recommendation

    Note over MCP,MR: Flow 4 - Model Registry query
    MCP->>K8s: Discover ModelRegistry CR / Service<br/>SA or user token
    K8s-->>MCP: Service endpoint
    MCP->>MR: REST 8080 HTTP no auth (preferred)<br/>or 8443 HTTPS TLS UNVERIFIED + Bearer
    MR-->>MCP: Registered models / versions
